REGENT OF TEMANGGUNG

PROVINCE OF CENTRAL JAVA

REGIONAL REGULATION OF TEMANGGUNG REGENCY

NUMBER 14 OF 2020

CONCERNING

EMPOWERMENT AND PROTECTION OF WOMEN

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF TEMANGGUNG,

Considering:
a. that every citizen has equal rights to live a dignified life in accordance with the principles of humanity, equality, and justice;
b. that empowerment of women is carried out so that women can actualize their potential optimally to participate in development according to their capacity;
