BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF TEMANGGUNG,

Considering:
a. that every citizen has equal rights to live a dignified life in accordance with the principles of humanity, equality, and justice;
b. that empowerment of women is carried out so that women can actualize their potential optimally to participate in development according to their capacity;
c. that women who are vulnerable groups need to receive special protection so that they do not experience violence and can live a decent life according to the principles of humanity, equality and justice;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Empowerment and Protection of Women;

